      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Anti_Semitism",
      "label": "Anti-Semitism",
      "description": "Discrimination, prejudice, or hostility directed against Jewish people. Hitler's regime was built on virulent anti-Semitism, which led to the Holocaust. The meme's implication that Hitler is universally feared is tied to the historical context of anti-Semitic hatred, making this concept critical to understanding the meme's hateful intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
