      "description": "The act of denying, minimizing, or distorting the historical reality of the Holocaust. The meme's glorification of Hitler as universally feared is a form of historical revisionism that implicitly promotes Holocaust denial by romanticizing his terror. Understanding this concept is necessary to recognize the meme's dangerous intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
