      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "fear",
      "label": "fear-inducing emotion",
      "description": "The emotion of fear is expressed through the text overlay 'every one is afraid of this man', which directly states that the subject is universally feared. This text, combined with the stern facial expression of Adolf Hitler in the portrait, creates an atmosphere of intimidation and terror. The emotion is not depicted through the subject's facial expression alone, but is explicitly communicated via the textual material, which is a form of hate speech glorifying terror.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
